WEBVTT

00:00:03.310 --> 00:00:05.650
Yay, Grandpa!

00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:07.340
Grandpa!

00:00:17.990 --> 00:00:20.920
Here, you can have these today.

00:00:21.470 --> 00:00:23.390
They’re so cute!

00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:25.210
What are they?

00:00:25.690 --> 00:00:28.270
This is a prince and this is a princess.

00:00:28.270 --> 00:00:30.220
It’s the Peach Festival today, after all.

00:00:30.220 --> 00:00:32.400
Oh, yeah.

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:36.490
So, this one is you, Grandpa,

00:00:36.490 --> 00:00:38.720
and this one is Grandma.

00:00:39.130 --> 00:00:41.120
Yeah.

00:00:41.120 --> 00:00:42.230
That’s right.

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:49.670
I hope you will find a handsome prince someday too.

00:00:49.670 --> 00:00:50.670
Yeah!

00:00:50.670 --> 00:00:51.760
It’s okay.

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:53.420
I’m sure I’ll find one.

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:54.260
I’m sure!

00:01:03.330 --> 00:01:08.590
So I don’t spill my wish from my eyes,

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:15.410
I want to make my heart race to you.

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:22.770
I put my feelings on this palette of endearment

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:28.400
and paint them on my heart.

00:01:29.360 --> 00:01:31.360
The sweetness

00:01:32.480 --> 00:01:36.450
and the strength you gave are sitting back to back.

00:01:36.450 --> 00:01:37.910
The time

00:01:39.660 --> 00:01:44.330
is drawing bells in the sky.

00:01:45.890 --> 00:01:52.470
Colorful assortments of balloons of dreams

00:01:52.470 --> 00:01:54.310
float in the wind,

00:01:54.310 --> 00:01:56.190
flowing toward you,

00:01:56.190 --> 00:01:59.660
freely.

00:01:59.660 --> 00:02:06.520
I’m happy that I found destiny.

00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:10.150
It’s filling with colors.

00:02:10.150 --> 00:02:15.150
The Summons of Love and Mercilessness!
A Great Execution!!

00:02:15.150 --> 00:02:19.530
Sorry, but Ryo-sama has given me permission to use all of my abilities.

00:02:19.910 --> 00:02:23.160
So I will be pretty rough on you!

00:02:30.940 --> 00:02:33.820
Emiho-san’s marriage problems are over,

00:02:33.820 --> 00:02:38.030
and we went back to acting normal.

00:02:38.860 --> 00:02:41.720
Although they didn’t say that they stopped dating,

00:02:42.120 --> 00:02:47.730
their relationship seems to be back to what it was before they started.

00:02:51.730 --> 00:02:54.730
I thought these enjoyable
days of excitement

00:02:54.730 --> 00:02:58.330
would last forever.

00:03:14.130 --> 00:03:16.140
I won’t go easy on you!

00:03:16.140 --> 00:03:17.720
Same here!

00:03:19.220 --> 00:03:21.220
Ready… go!

00:03:27.010 --> 00:03:28.350
No~!

00:03:28.350 --> 00:03:29.840
All right!

00:03:29.840 --> 00:03:34.360
You’re giving me a hard time, Akane-san.
But I can’t afford to lose!

00:03:43.010 --> 00:03:44.810
No, stop it…

00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:54.340
No enemy is too tough for
the warrior of love, Victory Shizuka!

00:03:54.340 --> 00:03:57.270
Okay, I’ll take you on next!

00:03:57.270 --> 00:03:58.470
I accept your challenge.

00:04:16.790 --> 00:04:21.220
In that case, here’s the Masuda Family’s final, secret attack!

00:04:21.220 --> 00:04:23.130
Ultimate Destruction Beam!

00:04:24.060 --> 00:04:25.160
What’s that attack?!

00:04:26.850 --> 00:04:27.510
Wha?!

00:04:27.510 --> 00:04:28.290
I can’t move!

00:04:33.100 --> 00:04:34.170
Yay!

00:04:34.170 --> 00:04:36.020
Yay! Yay!

00:04:36.020 --> 00:04:37.520
I won!

00:04:37.520 --> 00:04:39.110
I lost!

00:04:40.030 --> 00:04:44.570
You promised me that you would grant any request of mine if I won.

00:04:44.570 --> 00:04:46.030
Right, Ryo-sama?

00:04:46.030 --> 00:04:47.950
Anything you want, huh?

00:04:47.950 --> 00:04:51.870
I’m sure it’s going to be “please recognize me as your fiancée,” right?

00:04:51.870 --> 00:04:52.960
Oh, you already knew.

00:04:54.960 --> 00:04:57.960
Huh? What are you
talking about, Ryo-sama?

00:04:57.960 --> 00:05:00.170
I haven’t said anything yet!

00:05:00.170 --> 00:05:02.450
It’s your fault for cheating by using that controller!

00:05:02.970 --> 00:05:05.090
That one is invalid!

00:05:05.090 --> 00:05:08.550
We’ll play a fair game after finals!

00:05:08.550 --> 00:05:09.450
All right!

00:05:09.720 --> 00:05:11.810
Speaking of finals,

00:05:11.810 --> 00:05:15.940
you’re going to take the exams for both the first and the second year, right?

00:05:15.940 --> 00:05:16.960
That’s gotta be really tough.

00:05:17.480 --> 00:05:18.770
Oh, yeah.

00:05:19.400 --> 00:05:21.530
What are you planning to do?

00:05:21.530 --> 00:05:22.860
Don’t worry.

00:05:22.860 --> 00:05:26.650
We have arranged it so that I can go back to my former school on another day,

00:05:26.650 --> 00:05:27.970
so that I can take their exams.

00:05:27.970 --> 00:05:29.370
Huh?

00:05:29.370 --> 00:05:31.000
You’re going all the way
to your old school

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:33.480
to take tests you’d rather not take in the first place?

00:05:33.480 --> 00:05:38.230
But Sanyo Girl’s School is such an elite school, so the exams must be really hard.

00:05:39.250 --> 00:05:42.840
You were going to a school of that high caliber?

00:05:42.840 --> 00:05:44.920
You didn’t know?

00:05:44.920 --> 00:05:47.210
Well, uh, you know…

00:05:47.210 --> 00:05:49.970
So I guess we really shouldn’t be playing around.

00:05:49.970 --> 00:05:52.390
We’ll start studying again once tea time is over.

00:05:53.680 --> 00:05:54.770
Yes!

00:05:54.770 --> 00:05:59.750
I think it’s best if we procure our midnight snacks before we start studying!

00:06:00.190 --> 00:06:01.440
Well, she has…

00:06:01.440 --> 00:06:02.690
…a point.

00:06:03.670 --> 00:06:06.900
In that case, we’re off to the
convenience store by the station…

00:06:06.900 --> 00:06:08.720
Let’s go!

00:06:17.480 --> 00:06:18.710
Oh?

00:06:18.710 --> 00:06:21.360
I don’t recall summoning you today.

00:06:33.660 --> 00:06:35.810
Hey, Shizuka!

00:06:36.560 --> 00:06:38.230
Father!

00:06:38.230 --> 00:06:39.540
Father?

00:06:40.100 --> 00:06:45.190
Looks like you got involved with another one of your stupid games while I was gone.

00:06:45.190 --> 00:06:48.770
Well, I will forgive you for misusing the authority of the Masuda family

00:06:48.770 --> 00:06:50.360
for personal purposes.

00:06:52.530 --> 00:06:53.870
But…

00:06:53.870 --> 00:06:56.950
I don’t care if the childbirth rate
is declining.

00:06:56.950 --> 00:07:00.290
Do you really think you can be so stupid as to get married

00:07:00.290 --> 00:07:06.050
to a complete stranger without the permission of me, your father?

00:07:07.840 --> 00:07:10.100
Without the permission of your parents?

00:07:10.100 --> 00:07:13.600
You know, we never checked the validity…

00:07:13.600 --> 00:07:14.600
No…

00:07:15.390 --> 00:07:19.310
Shizuka, I will grant you a one week grace period.

00:07:19.310 --> 00:07:22.810
Organize your current situation during that time. Then, you will come home!

00:07:22.810 --> 00:07:25.110
Come home?!

00:07:32.180 --> 00:07:33.680
Oh, yes.

00:07:34.870 --> 00:07:39.020
Your favorite chairman has fallen ill.

00:07:39.500 --> 00:07:40.650
Grandfather has?!

00:07:40.650 --> 00:07:42.920
They say the condition is serious.

00:07:42.920 --> 00:07:46.880
Wouldn’t he be looking forward
to your return?

00:07:56.140 --> 00:07:57.350
No way…

00:07:57.720 --> 00:08:00.660
Why… Grandfather…

00:08:02.310 --> 00:08:05.670
You will explain all of this, right?

00:08:12.010 --> 00:08:14.740
So, all that talk about the R.T.P. committee, marriage, and all that…

00:08:14.740 --> 00:08:16.950
how much of it was true?

00:08:16.950 --> 00:08:19.790
It was all true.

00:08:19.790 --> 00:08:24.380
But your father didn’t know anything about it.

00:08:27.210 --> 00:08:30.380
My father is always busy with his business,

00:08:30.380 --> 00:08:33.800
so he is never actually with me.

00:08:33.800 --> 00:08:36.430
But my grandfather has…

00:08:36.430 --> 00:08:38.790
My grandfather approved the matter this time.

00:08:39.270 --> 00:08:40.770
Your grandfather, huh?

00:08:41.310 --> 00:08:43.580
So he was behind all this.

00:09:14.050 --> 00:09:15.380
Hey, Shizuka,

00:09:16.430 --> 00:09:21.170
wouldn’t it be best for you to go home for now, just like your dad said?

00:09:21.170 --> 00:09:22.260
But…

00:09:22.260 --> 00:09:23.440
Brother!

00:09:23.440 --> 00:09:27.860
I know how he is; he wouldn’t let me
leave once I came back!

00:09:27.860 --> 00:09:29.670
Then I would never be able
to see you again!

00:09:30.530 --> 00:09:32.380
Then are you going to forget about your grandfather?!

00:09:35.530 --> 00:09:36.640
That’s why…

00:09:38.370 --> 00:09:40.040
That’s why I can’t go back.

00:09:40.040 --> 00:09:44.900
Going home without results will only make Grandfather more sad!

00:09:46.960 --> 00:09:48.130
Why?!

00:09:48.130 --> 00:09:51.840
Why would your grandfather be so adamant about our marriage?!

00:09:51.840 --> 00:09:55.530
Why does my refusal to get married make your grandfather sad?!

00:09:57.180 --> 00:09:58.600
Well…

00:09:58.600 --> 00:10:02.370
I will tell you everything
if you agree to marry me.

00:10:02.370 --> 00:10:03.930
Don’t joke around!

00:10:03.930 --> 00:10:05.350
You won’t?

00:10:05.350 --> 00:10:06.040
Of course not!

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:07.420
Don’t say that!

00:10:07.420 --> 00:10:08.420
No.

00:10:08.940 --> 00:10:09.800
No matter what?

00:10:10.230 --> 00:10:11.050
No!

00:10:11.050 --> 00:10:13.820
Oh, Ryo-sama!

00:10:14.280 --> 00:10:15.360
I will not!

00:10:15.360 --> 00:10:16.820
I’ve been telling you since the beginning!

00:10:16.820 --> 00:10:19.200
I will never agree to such a ridiculous thing!

00:10:19.200 --> 00:10:22.490
Then I cannot tell you the reason either.

00:10:25.620 --> 00:10:26.850
Then I can’t help it.

00:10:28.220 --> 00:10:29.850
Does that mean…

00:10:31.090 --> 00:10:35.840
If you want to stay here to make me agree to the marriage just as you have been doing,

00:10:35.840 --> 00:10:37.550
then you may do as you wish.

00:10:37.550 --> 00:10:39.490
However, you only have one week!

00:10:40.550 --> 00:10:41.490
Brother!

00:10:41.800 --> 00:10:44.060
Her father is telling her to come home.

00:10:44.060 --> 00:10:47.810
We, as outsiders, have no place in this family dispute.

00:10:47.810 --> 00:10:51.020
Well, I know that, but…

00:10:51.020 --> 00:10:54.150
Besides, Shizuka mentioned this as well.

00:10:54.150 --> 00:10:57.780
She needs to go back there to take her exams anyway.

00:11:00.160 --> 00:11:03.510
There is no way that this life
could go on forever.

00:11:15.510 --> 00:11:18.670
After that, we had a talk,

00:11:32.860 --> 00:11:38.840
and we decided not to do anything special for the coming week.

00:11:39.780 --> 00:11:41.840
We will spend the time just as we normally would.

00:11:42.450 --> 00:11:46.370
Then we will go back to our former lives.

00:11:46.950 --> 00:11:49.410
We believed that this was the best way.

00:11:51.210 --> 00:11:54.860
There is only one thing
that is certain right now:

00:11:54.860 --> 00:11:59.710
Shizuka-chan will not be here
a week from today.

00:12:00.760 --> 00:12:03.430
But I’m not satisfied with this!

00:12:03.430 --> 00:12:04.640
What about you, Brother?!

00:12:04.640 --> 00:12:05.870
Tell me how you feel!

00:12:05.870 --> 00:12:08.750
To be continued

00:12:10.280 --> 00:12:13.320
The moment came

00:12:14.160 --> 00:12:17.320
very much out of the blue.

00:12:18.560 --> 00:12:22.460
You showed up right in front of me,

00:12:22.460 --> 00:12:25.180
then started to change everything.

00:12:26.190 --> 00:12:29.010
If my meeting you

00:12:29.910 --> 00:12:32.860
is not by fate,

00:12:34.210 --> 00:12:38.220
there are no miracles,

00:12:38.220 --> 00:12:43.410
even if I search all over the world.

00:12:43.610 --> 00:12:46.800
Embracing love,

00:12:47.610 --> 00:12:50.730
kissing love,

00:12:51.480 --> 00:12:54.660
holding love,

00:12:55.160 --> 00:12:58.970
I whisper, “I love you.”

00:12:58.970 --> 00:13:02.990
Please look at me and me alone,

00:13:02.990 --> 00:13:06.410
forever.
